  abilityDesc: 41 combo powerful Light attack on all foes, 5 combo massive Light
    attack on single foe (damage relative to remaining HP), Spark damage considerably
    boosts BB gauge for 3 turns, greatly boosts critical damage for 3 turns, hugely
    boosts Atk, Def, Rec for 3 turns, enormously boosts critical hit rate for 3 turns
    & adds probable evasion for 2 turns
